{"ts":"2026-07-16T17:12:22.553Z","author":"codex-root","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"The repository collects V8 coverage but configures no minimum thresholds, so meaningful regressions can remain green. Capture the post-upgrade baseline, establish conservative global floors below current results, and keep the richer HTML/LCOV artifacts available for future ratchets."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"searx-coverage-governance"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Establish non-regressing coverage policy"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Turn the existing coverage report into an enforceable quality gate at a realistic baseline."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Task"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["ci","coverage","quality","tests"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-16T17:12:22.553Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-16T17:12:22.553Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/deadline","value":"2026-07-19T17:12:22.553Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/assignee","value":"codex-root"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"codex-root"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":45},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Coverage execution fails below documented global branch/function/line/statement floors and passes at the current repository baseline"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/definition_of_ready","value":"Current full-unit coverage report is available."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"searx-repository-audit"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":95},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/sprint","value":"2026-07-recovery"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/release","value":"next"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"searx-remote-fetch-hardening","kind":"blocked_by","created_at":"2026-07-16T17:12:22.553Z"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-16T17:12:22.553Z","author":"codex-root","text":"The audit found coverage reporters configured without thresholds."}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-16T17:12:22.553Z","author":"codex-root","text":"Use deliberately conservative floors so this recovery does not pretend the current 2,660-line command module is already well covered."}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/learnings","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-16T17:12:22.553Z","author":"codex-root","text":"A generated coverage report is observability, not a regression gate, until thresholds are configured."}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/files","value":[{"path":"vitest.config.ts","scope":"project","note":"Coverage policy"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tests","value":[{"command":"bun run test:coverage","scope":"project","timeout_seconds":180}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/docs","value":[{"path":"CONTRIBUTING.md","scope":"project","note":"Contributor verification guidance"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"5f710c031f39a733ce2c95e8f35dcc9c8c661a4f06f586ea3697f06980511747","message":"Track enforceable coverage baseline"}
